WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:10.480
Mendel counted 7,324 seeds from his round by wrinkled pea hybrids.

2
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:15.020
That is 2.96 round for every wrinkled seed.

3
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.380
Yet the hybrids themselves had all been round.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.640
So the wrinkled form vanished, then came back in about one seed in four.

5
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.980
What must a plant carry to give those numbers?

6
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:32.150
Think of each plant as holding two cards for seed shape.

7
00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.470
Each card is an allele.

8
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.750
Capital R is the round allele.

9
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:40.530
Small r is the wrinkled allele.

10
00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:46.230
A hybrid holds one of each, so its genotype is Rr.

11
00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:51.810
When it makes eggs and pollen, it hands one card, at random, into each.

12
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:55.970
So it makes R and r gametes in equal numbers.

13
00:00:56.883 --> 00:00:59.903
Now let the hybrid pollinate itself.

14
00:01:00.783 --> 00:01:03.163
Its eggs and pollen meet at random.

15
00:01:04.263 --> 00:01:10.403
R meets R and gives RR. R meets r and gives Rr.

16
00:01:11.183 --> 00:01:17.203
So does r meeting R. And r meeting r gives rr.

17
00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:26.343
The offspring are one quarter RR, one half Rr, and one quarter rr.

18
00:01:26.367 --> 00:01:28.807
Now ask what the seeds look like.

19
00:01:29.727 --> 00:01:32.207
One R is enough to make a round seed.

20
00:01:32.787 --> 00:01:36.547
So RR and Rr look the same.

21
00:01:37.327 --> 00:01:40.127
Only rr seeds are wrinkled.

22
00:01:41.307 --> 00:01:46.067
Mendel called round the dominant character, and wrinkled the recessive character,

23
00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:47.727
the one that becomes latent.

24
00:01:47.727 --> 00:01:52.967
So three quarters of the seeds are round, and one quarter are wrinkled.

25
00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:58.007
Round seeds should hold two kinds of plant that look alike.

26
00:01:59.147 --> 00:02:05.067
Mendel grew 565 plants from round seeds and let each one pollinate itself.

27
00:02:06.487 --> 00:02:09.187
193 gave only round seeds.

28
00:02:10.247 --> 00:02:15.267
372 gave round and wrinkled seeds again, at about 3 to 1.

29
00:02:16.007 --> 00:02:21.527
So about one third were RR, and about two thirds were Rr.

30
00:02:22.367 --> 00:02:24.867
This is the law of segregation.

31
00:02:25.787 --> 00:02:29.707
The two alleles of a plant separate into different gametes.

32
00:02:30.287 --> 00:02:31.787
Each gamete carries one.

33
00:02:32.607 --> 00:02:33.947
Keep two things apart.

34
00:02:35.327 --> 00:02:37.727
Three to one is a phenotype ratio.

35
00:02:38.227 --> 00:02:39.307
It is what you see.

36
00:02:40.427 --> 00:02:43.507
One to two to one is a genotype ratio.

37
00:02:44.087 --> 00:02:45.507
It is what the plant carries.
